---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Fixoraa" description="Fixoraa's privacy policy: no accounts and no personal data collection. Tools run in your browser; game scores stay on your device. Our free tools are supported by ads and privacy-friendly analytics — disclosed below.">
<main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:py-14">
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
    <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF5A5F] via-[#F43F8E] to-[#9333EA] mb-4">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-neutral-900">Privacy <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF5A5F] via-[#F43F8E] to-[#9333EA] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Policy</span></h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-500">Last updated: October 8, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <article class="space-y-8 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
    <section>
      <p class="text-lg text-neutral-800">The short version: <strong class="text-neutral-900">we don't collect your personal data.</strong> There are no accounts, no logins and no personal profiles. We use privacy-friendly analytics to understand overall traffic, and our free tool sites show banner ads from third-party ad networks (details below). Fixoraa is built so that privacy is the default, not a setting.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">1. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>Essentially none. We do not ask you to create an account, sign in, or provide your name, email or any other personal information to use our tools. We do not build profiles about you and we do not sell, rent or share your data. If you choose to contact us through our contact or tool-request forms, the name and email you share are sent to our form provider (Formspree) only so we can reply.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">2. How our tools handle your data</h2>
      <p>Most Fixoraa tools run entirely in your browser: whatever you type into a calculator, converter or text tool is processed on your own device and never sent to our servers. A small number of tools offer AI features (such as generating text or analysing an image); in those cases your input is sent once to our backend service to produce the result, and it is not stored, logged against an identity, or used to train models.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">3. Cookies and advertising</h2>
      <p>We do not set any of our own cookies. Our main site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics — a privacy-friendly analytics tool that does not track you across sites — to understand overall traffic. Our free tool sites are supported by banner ads from third-party ad networks (such as Adsterra and Monetag, and Google AdSense where approved). Those ad networks may set their own cookies or use device identifiers to serve and measure ads, and they may see standard technical information such as your IP address when your browser loads an ad — exactly as with any website you visit. You can opt out of personalised Google ads in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" class="font-semibold text-[#9333EA] hover:underline" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's Ads Settings</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">4. Data stored on your device</h2>
      <p>Our games (for example Chess vs AI, Sudoku and the daily word game) may save your high scores, streaks and preferences using <code class="text-sm bg-neutral-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">localStorage</code> — a small storage area inside your own browser. This data never leaves your device, and you can delete it at any time by clearing your browser's site data. We cannot see it, access it, or restore it.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">5. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>We keep third parties to a minimum. Pages may load open-source libraries and fonts from public content-delivery networks (CDNs) so the site loads quickly; those networks may see standard technical information such as your IP address when your browser fetches those files, exactly as with any website you visit. We use Cloudflare for hosting, performance, security and privacy-friendly analytics. Our free tool sites display banner ads served by third-party ad networks, which may use cookies or device identifiers for ad delivery and measurement. We do not use social-media widgets.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">6. Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>Fixoraa is safe for everyone, including children: since we collect no personal information from anyone, there is nothing further to protect. Parents and guardians can let children use the site with confidence.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">7. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If we ever change how the site handles data — for example, by adding a feature that requires an account — we will update this page and revise the "Last updated" date above. Because we collect nothing today, any future change that does collect something will be clearly disclosed here first.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">8. Contact us</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy? Write to us at <a href="mailto:official@fixoraa.tech" class="font-semibold text-[#9333EA] hover:underline">official@fixoraa.tech</a> and we'll answer honestly — it's a small team, so you'll hear back from the person who built the site.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</main>
</Layout>
